<description>&lt;p&gt;Libyan armed forces have executed 31 people after unfair military trials, breaking a 15‑year moratorium, while rights groups report eastern authorities carrying out executions and 50 detainees face imminent execution. Heavy rainfall in Tripoli caused at least three deaths in one incident and two deaths in separate incidents, adding to flood-related casualties. The European Union has expanded migration cooperation with eastern Libya, and China has called for an end to Libya’s political deadlock. A football match between Morocco and Libya will be broadcast on beIN SPORTS as part of the 2026 Futsal AFCON. There were two battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNTWl3LWFWaVhsR3REWDE4eGFQdEZRRXdSN1ZSU29qU3phY2JONnBWN1ZnYUNvZS16dnRzcWV0MmM2Ql9kSkpMMk1xRUlmUS0ySUdzaHJVQWpqalpMNnRSSTdVMW94c2p0TGlOck1mQVNWOThBRUVKbTktWUJZNlp1bVRpQVFfZEpFOTkxMUs3LVRxQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sada Elbalad English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxQQWRKV1Jrbi1OUlo4a29lVmN6eG5lb3Mtc08xUDVabkYwQzdKLXZiVHJYSFFXYXRVek9ISmZPQ1JFSXl4MlRoQWhpTTlGTzZwZlJOaVNodXJEREFIZmtCNkF0ejBXclVFNkZJUl9KMEoyaHNZNlU5NjR4SG5ONWVZLUlDbkxFUjAyR0FTSFp0T04tQV9qZmp6akVHVXI3NnhMa2ZlT21rd1lWamZWNUNLaA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Africanews English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPRWxZeHg0UkFHeWwwZElzMWdOdi1vZ3hlRktocG93NllZaHZHYl9nWHJOSjRKTGlrWEZRS2drYnRacnJwc01ZWTVVYko4b1Z1Q3BaVUFtQ1lPSFFPdVNmUGRNOEJSX3FKVEJRUWRWZk55eHkxRXNLclczNUJxYWV0ZE5xbG80Y3VTTXR4VWNncU56eUNLT053Q1RmWEUwY1BuTUVqb1lIZjlJNlNsSV9kb0hiZlVDQWZza0FZV2V0cllsUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Jurist.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;beIN SPORTS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt